# Multi-domain split (2026-07-28) — public-customer/, public-seller/,
# public-admin/ are generated by backend/scripts/build-public.js from
# public-shared/ + public-<audience>-src/ (the real sources, which ARE
# committed). Never edit inside the generated folders directly — a build
# always deletes and rebuilds them from scratch, so any edit made there is
# silently lost on the next deploy. If `git status` ever shows changes
# inside one of these three folders, that's the signal something was
# edited in the wrong place.
public-customer/
public-seller/
